{"id":"6d541e6684012418","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-contapriori-mltest.md","title":"Continuous A Priori Characterization of Randomness","display":"thm-contapriori-mltest — Continuous A Priori Characterization of Randomness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-contapriori-mltest","aliases":["43-thm-contapriori-mltest"],"display":"thm-contapriori-mltest — Continuous A Priori Characterization of Randomness","depends_on":["[[43-df-continuous-apriori]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 10.1.5; Theorem 10.1.7; §10.1.2 correspondence","source_printed_pages":"207–210","source_pdf_pages":"227–230","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-contapriori-mltest"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-contapriori-mltest</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-contapriori-mltest — Continuous A Priori Characterization of Randomness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1843130733da3f0\" href=\"?note=e1843130733da3f0\" title=\"43-df-continuous-apriori\">43-df-continuous-apriori</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 10.1.5; Theorem 10.1.7; §10.1.2 correspondence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"207–210"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"227–230"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M\">\\(\\mathbf M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e1843130733da3f0\" href=\"?note=e1843130733da3f0\" title=\"43-df-continuous-apriori\">43-df-continuous-apriori</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbf M(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le c\\,2^{-n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbf M(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le c\\,2^{-n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(\\sigma)=2^{|\\sigma|}\\mathbf M(\\sigma)\">\\(d(\\sigma)=2^{|\\sigma|}\\mathbf M(\\sigma)\\)</span> 得到最优有效超鞅，随机性等价于该超鞅沿路径有界。旧定义的机器求和已被正确的连续半测度替换。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 10.1.5; Theorem 10.1.7; §10.1.2 correspondence；印刷页 207–210，PDF 页 227–230。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-continuous-apriori","status":"resolved","id":"e1843130733da3f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-continuous-apriori]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-continuous-apriori","status":"resolved","id":"e1843130733da3f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathbf M$ 见 [[43-df-continuous-apriori]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathbf M$ 见 [[43-df-continuous-apriori]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbf M(X\\upharpoonright n)\\le c\\,2^{-n}.","display":true},{"tex":"d(\\sigma)=2^{|\\sigma|}\\mathbf M(\\sigma)","display":false}],"bytes":1521,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-contapriori-mltest]] — Continuous A Priori Characterization of Randomness"}],"out